  "reference": "1 Samuele 10",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Samuele wakangata mulondo wa manyi, wakâhongolola ha mutu handi, wakamutua mishiku, wakamba ne, Yehowa kakakuela manyi bua wewe wikale mukelenge ku mutu kua buhianyi buandi, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haumuka kundi lelu, wewe neusungile ne balume babidi ha majambu a Lakele ku Selesa ku mukata wa buloba bua Benyamina; bobo nebakuambile ne, Nyama ya mpunda îwakaya kukeba yakamueneka; mona, tatu webe wakalekela kunyingalasha mutshima bua nyama ya mpunda, udi unyingalasha mutshima bualu buebe, wamba ne, Nengenze tshinyi bua muanʼanyi wa balume? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe bûdi nʼabu mbua kumuka ku muaba au tô ne hawafika ku mutshi wa telebinta wa ku Tabô; wewe neusangileku ne balume basatu baya ku Betele bua kutendelela Nzambi, umue mutuale bana ba mbushi basatu, mukuabo muambule mitanda ya bidia isatu, ne mukuabo muambule mulondo wa nvinyo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bobo nebakuele muoyo, nebakuhe mitanda ya bidia ibidi, bûdi nʼabu mbua kuyangata ku bianza biabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe bûdi nʼabu mbua kuya ku mukuna wa Nzambi, kudi masalayi a Bena Peleshete; hawafika ha buihi ne musoko, neusangile ne tshisumbu tshia baprofete bafume ku mutu kua mukuna badi ne lunzenze lua nshinga dikumi ne dizele ne lushiba ne tshisanji; bobo mene nebikale bamba dî dia Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma wa Yehowa neakutulukile bikole, wewe newambe nʼabo dî dia Nzambi, wewe neukudimuke bu mu ntu mukuabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe, halua bimanyinu ebi bionso kûdi, enza muonso mûdi mua kuenza, bualu bua Nzambi udi nʼebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bûdi nʼabu mbua kudianjila ku mpala kuanyi ku Gilegala; ne mona, meme nempueke kûdi bua kufila milambu ya kuosha ha kahia ne milambu ya kuvuishila nʼai bantu ditalala; ungindileku matuku muanda mutekete ne hanalua bua kukulesha bualu bûdi ne bua kuenza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bulelela, hakeleye nyima bua kumuka kudi Samuele, Nzambi wakamuha mutshima mukuabo; ne bimanyinu abi bionso biakalua dituku adi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakafikabo ku mukuna, monai, tshisumbu tshia baprofete tshikasangila nʼandi: Nyuma wa Nzambi wakatulukila Shaula bikole, ne yeye wakamba dî dia Nzambi munkatshi muabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakatangila bantu bakadi bamumanye diambedi ne, Monai, yeye udi wamba dî dia Nzambi ne baprofete, bakakonkangana ne, Bualu ebu buakulua kudi muana wa Kishi budi tshinyi? Shaula udi munkatshi mua baprofete, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muena muaba au wakabakonka ne, Tatu wabo udi nganyi? Nunku dî edi diakalua bu lusumuinu ne, Shaula udi munkatshi mua baprofete, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakashikisheye kuamba dî dia Nzambi, yeye wakabanda ku mukuna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mansebʼa Shaula wakamuambila ne muena mudimu wandi ne, Nuakaya kudi kunyi? Wakamba ne, Ku dikeba dia nyama ya mpunda; hatuakamona ne kayena imueneka, tuakulua kudi Samuele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mansebʼa Shaula wakamba ne, Ndi nkusengelela ne ungambileku tshiakakuambila Samuele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaula wakambila mansebʼandi ne. Yeye wakatujukuila ne, Nyama ya mpunda yakamueneka. Kadi yeye kakamuambila bualu bua bukelenge buakamuambila Samuele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samuele wakabikila bantu bua kudisangishabo kudi Yehowa ku Misepa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakambila Bena Isalele ne, Yehowa, Nzambi wa Isalele, udi wamba ne, Nakumuka ne Isalele mu Ejipitu, nakanusungila mu bianza bia Bena Ejipitu ne mu bianza bia makelenge onso akadi anukengesha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi nuenu nuakahidia Nzambi wenu udi unusungila mu makenga enu ne mu ntatu yenu lelu, nuakangambila ne, Nansha, utusungile mukelenge bua bikaleye ku mutu kuetu. Nunku numueneke ku mesu kua Yehowa ku bisamba bienu ne ku binunu bienu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samuele wakabikila bisamba bionso bia Bena Isalele ha buihi, bakasungula tshisamba tshia Benyamina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakabikila tshisamba tshia Benyamina ha buihi ku meku abo ne ku meku abo: bakasungula diku dia Bena Mâteli; bakasungula Shaula, muana mulume wa Kishi. Kadi hakayabo bua kumubikila, kabakamusangana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku bakebesha Yehowa ne, Muntu mukuabo ulualua, anyi? Yehowa wakabambila ne, Monai, yeye wakadisokoka munkatshi mua bintu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakaya lubilu, bakaha handi: hakimaneye munkatshi mua bantu, yeye wakafuta buonso buabo bule ku makaya ne ku mutu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samuele wakambila bantu bonso ne, Tangilai, yeye wakadi Yehowa musungule kakuena mukuabo bu yeye munkatshi mua bantu bonso. Bantu bonso bakela mbila ne, Mukelenge ikale ne muoyo!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samuele wakajinguluila bantu mushindu wa bukelenge, wakafunda mu mukanda, wakauteka ku mpala kua Yehowa. Samuele wakatuma bantu bonso muntu ku nsubu wandi muntu ku nsubu wandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaula wakahingana ku nsubu kuandi ku Gibea; ne tshisumbu tshia bantu bakole bakadi Nzambi ulamakasha mitshima yabo kudiye tshiakaya nʼandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi bantu bakuabo balembakane bakakonkangana ne, Muntu eu neatusungile munyi? Nunku bakamulengulula, kabakamuha kantu kakese. Kadi yeye wakahuwa biandi talalâ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
